# HostelEase – Project Overview

## Introduction
HostelEase is a hostel booking management system designed to help students find available hostels, view accommodation details, make reservations, and manage their bookings.

## Project Purpose
To make hostel searching and booking easier, faster, and more convenient for students.

## Main Features
1. Search for available hostels.
2. View hostel details.
3. Book hostel accommodation.
4. Manage reservations.
5. Track booking status.